  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing resilience in Palestinian Communities in the West Bank, Jordan and Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports programming by the United Nations Population Fund (UNFPA) and United Nations Childrens Fund (UNICEF), working with Palestinian communities in the West Bank, Jordan and Lebanon. It cuts across the sectors of health and nutrition; education, adolescents and youth; child protection; gender equality and women&#x2019;s empowerment; water, sanitation and hygiene; and social policy and social protection. It is expected to deliver towards Australia&#x2019;s goals of: enhancing state and community resilience; inclusive development cooperation; gender equality; human rights and civil liberties; improved governance; and economic empowerment.</narrative>
  </description>
